---

<!-- 
  SECTION 02: ABOUT & MANIFESTO (GoUncharted Editorial Architecture)
  - Warm Stone Editorial Canvas (#f5f1ea) with Deep Obsidian Typography (#141110)
  - Scroll-Driven Word-by-Word Text Reveal (Tadinya samar -> Terang penuh seiring scroll)
  - Clean & Breathable: Negative space, zero heavy box clutter
  - Minimalist Editorial Stats Strip (4 Kolom Tipografi Raksasa)
  - 100+ Corporate Partner Rail Marquee
-->
<section id="tentang" class="relative z-20 bg-[#f5f1ea] text-[#141110] py-24 sm:py-32 px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-14 xl:px-20 transition-colors duration-300">
  <div class="max-w-[1680px] mx-auto flex flex-col gap-16 sm:gap-24">

    <!-- Top Eyebrow Bar -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between pb-8 border-b border-[#141110]/15 gap-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xs font-mono-tag text-[#141110]/80 tracking-widest uppercase">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-700 animate-pulse"></span>
        <span>COMPANY OVERVIEW & MANIFESTO</span>
      </div>
      <div class="text-xs font-mono-tag text-[#141110]/60 uppercase tracking-wider">
        DAN GROUP ECOSYSTEM
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Editorial Statement & Transformation Story -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Big Typographic Statement with Word Reveal -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-8 flex flex-col">
        <h2 
          id="manifesto-reveal-heading"
          class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-[3.8rem] xl:text-[4.4rem] leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#141110]"
        >
          <span class="font-light">
            {headlinePart1.map((word) => (
              <span 
                class="reveal-word inline-block mr-[0.24em] transition-opacity duration-150 ease-out will-change-[opacity]" 
                style="opacity: 0.18;"
              >
                {word}
              </span>
            ))}
          </span>
          <span class="font-bold text-emerald-950">
            {headlinePart2.map((word) => (
              <span 
                class="reveal-word inline-block mr-[0.24em] transition-opacity duration-150 ease-out will-change-[opacity]" 
                style="opacity: 0.18;"
              >
                {word}
              </span>
            ))}
          </span>
        </h2>

        <!-- Milestone Callout Minimalist -->
        <div class="mt-10 p-6 sm:p-7 bg-white/70 border border-[#141110]/10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 items-start sm:items-center justify-between">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono-tag px-3 py-1 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold border border-[#141110]/20 text-[#141110]">
              EST. 2023
            </span>
            <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#141110]/80 leading-relaxed font-light">
              <strong class="font-semibold text-[#141110]">Tonggak Pencapaian:</strong> Bermula dari inisiatif 4 tenda internal Dan Group untuk gathering privat, kini berkembang menjadi destinasi ekowisata terpadu pionir di lereng Gunung Wilis.
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="shrink-0 text-xs font-mono-tag text-[#141110]/60 tracking-wider uppercase sm:text-right">
            <span>DUSUN PLAKAT</span>
            <span class="block text-[10px] text-[#141110]/45 mt-0.5 font-normal">BUKA SETIAP HARI • 09.00–22.00</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Narrative Story & Official Vision -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col justify-between h-full pt-2">
        <div class="space-y-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#141110]/80 font-light leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            <strong>Jolotundo Glamping & Edupark</strong>, bagian dari ekosistem bisnis <strong>Dan Group</strong>, adalah pelopor destinasi wisata terpadu di Kabupaten Nganjuk yang menghadirkan ruang di mana pengunjung dapat terhubung kembali dengan alam, mendalami budaya lokal, dan membangun kebersamaan.
          </p>
          <p>
            Didukung lanskap asri Desa Bajulan, kami merancang fasilitas glamping tematik, wahana petualangan seru, hingga program outbound korporat yang edukatif dan menumbuhkan karakter, dengan komitmen teguh terhadap <em>sustainable tourism</em>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Direct CTA to WA Booking & Profil -->
        <div class="pt-8 lg:pb-4">
          <a
            href={`https://wa.me/${siteData.brand.whatsapp}?text=${encodeURIComponent("Halo Admin Jolotundo, saya ingin konsultasi profil kawasan, reservasi glamping, dan paket outbound.")}`}
